; On-chain swap between two tokens that have NO price feed. The DEX call also
; emits a 0-amount ETH contract-interaction leg under the same hash, listed
; LAST so it is the final leg indexed for that hash. Both swap legs must stay
; unpriced: deriving a price from the 0-amount sibling stamps `@ 0 AUD`, which
; gives the CGT report a zero cost base and zero proceeds.

2025-03-01 10:00:00 * "Uniswap" "Swap ABC for XYZ" ; txn:0xshared
    assets:wallet:eth -100 ABC
    equity:trading:sell 100 ABC

2025-03-01 10:00:00 * "Uniswap" "Receive XYZ" ; txn:0xshared
    assets:wallet:eth 250 XYZ
    equity:trading:buy -250 XYZ

2025-03-01 10:00:00 * "Uniswap" "Contract interaction" ; txn:0xshared
    assets:wallet:eth 0 ETH
    expenses:unknown 0 ETH
